{title: Every Breath You Take}
{artist: The Police}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[G] [Gadd9] [Em] [Emadd9] [C] [Cadd9] [D] [Dadd9] [G] [Gadd9]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Every breath you [G]take [Gadd9]
And every move you [Em]make [Emadd9]
Every bond you [C]break [Cadd9]
Every step you [D]take
Every single [Em]day [Emadd9]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Every single [G]day [Gadd9]
And every word you [Em]make [Emadd9]
Every game you [C]play [Cadd9]
Every night you [D]stay
I'll be watching you [G] [Gadd9]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Oh, can't you [C]see [Cadd9]
You belong to [G]me [Gadd9]
How my poor heart [A]aches
With every step you [D]take
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Every move you [G]make [Gadd9]
And every vow you [Em]make [Emadd9]
Every smile you [C]fake [Cadd9]
Every claim you [D]stake
I'll be watching you [G] [Gadd9]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb] Since you've gone, I've been lost without a [F]trace
I dream at night, I can only see your [Eb]face
I look around, but it's you I can't re[F]place
I feel so cold, and I long for your em[Eb]brace
I keep crying, baby, baby, [G]please [Gadd9] [Em] [Emadd9] [C] [D] [G]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Guitar Solo}
[G] [Gadd9] [Em] [Emadd9] [C] [Cadd9] [D] [Dadd9] [G] [Gadd9]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Oh, can't you [C]see [Cadd9]
You belong to [G]me [Gadd9]
How my poor heart [A]aches
With every step you [D]take
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Every breath you [G]take [Gadd9]
And every move you [Em]make [Emadd9]
Every bond you [C]break [Cadd9]
Every step you [D]take
I'll be watching you [Em]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Every step you [D]take, I'll be watching you [G] [Gadd9] [Em] [Emadd9]
I'll be watching you [C] [Cadd9]
I'll be watching you [G] [Gadd9] [Em] [Emadd9]
I'll be watching you [C] [Cadd9] [G]
{end_of_verse}
